# 结构示例，请勿直接 apply。同目录上级另有 rabbitmq-auth-secret.yaml.example 可参考；各集群复制为 rabbitmq-auth-secret.yaml 后填写 base64。
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: rabbitmq-auth-secret
  namespace: messaging-platform-dev
type: Opaque
data:
  rabbitmq-erlang-cookie: ""
  rabbitmq-password: ""
  rabbitmq-username: ""
